  theforest: "The Forest dedicated server has no supported server-side mod loader on Linux.",
  sonsoftheforest: "Sons of the Forest server mods (BepInEx/RedLoader) aren't wired — the server image doesn't ship a mod loader.",
  bedrock: "Bedrock add-ons (.mcpack) aren't in the catalogue yet. Upload behavior packs into the world folder in Files.",
  schedule1: "Schedule I has no official dedicated server.",
  dragonwilds: "RuneScape: Dragonwilds has no server-side mod system yet.",
  sunkenland: "Sunkenland server mods (BepInEx) aren't wired — the server image doesn't ship BepInEx.",
  abioticfactor: "Abiotic Factor has no server-side mod pipeline we can install from yet.",
  corekeeper: "Core Keeper's mods are on mod.io, which requires an API key per game — not wired yet.",
  icarus: "Icarus has no Workshop integration for dedicated servers.",
  arkasa: "ARK: Survival Ascended mods are on CurseForge, which requires an API key — not wired yet.",
  nightingale: "Nightingale has no server-side mod system yet.",
  spaceengineers: "Space Engineers Workshop/mod.io mods aren't wired for the Linux server yet.",
  barotrauma: "Barotrauma content packages aren't wired yet (needs a verified config_player.xml edit).",
  sandstorm: "Insurgency: Sandstorm mods are on mod.io, which needs an API key — not wired yet.",
  mordhau: "Mordhau mods are on mod.io, which needs an API key — not wired yet.",
  theisle: "The Isle (Evrima) has no mod ecosystem yet.",
  stationeers: "Stationeers Workshop content isn't wired yet.",
  eco: "Eco mods are on mod.io, which needs an API key — not wired yet.",
  plutoniumt4: "Plutonium servers load usermaps/scripts you upload in Files — there's no catalogue to install from.",
  plutoniumt5: "Plutonium servers load usermaps/scripts you upload in Files — there's no catalogue to install from.",
  plutoniumt6: "Plutonium servers load usermaps/scripts you upload in Files — there's no catalogue to install from.",
  plutoniumiw5: "Plutonium servers load usermaps/scripts you upload in Files — there's no catalogue to install from.",
  cs16: "CS 1.6 AMX Mod X plugins need compiling per server — not wired yet. Upload .amxx files in Files.",
  ets2: "Euro Truck Simulator 2 servers mirror your own game profile's mods — export server_packages and upload them in Files.",
